    "description": "The work involved in this position refers to a set of web-based and windows applications for courier companies.\n\nTasks:\n\n· Design and implementation of a large-scale distributed client/server application.\n\n· Multitier client-server architecture design and implementation in VB.Net.\n\n· Feature development in ASP 3.0, ASP.NET, VB.NET . Among others, this includes\ninvoice managing and order tracking using Google Maps API and GPS for positioning.\nThis last one involves retrieving data asynchronously using AJAX and storing GPS\npositions in the SQL Server Data Bases with a large number of fields (clients, type of\nservice, type of service priority, etc ).\n\n· Unit/Component Testing prior to code submission.\n\n· Multithreading using VB.Net Background Worker.\n\n· Implementation of Multi user Windows Forms Applications.\n\n· Design and implementation of custom controls in CSS.\n\n· Design and implementation of Windows and Web Services.\n\n· Management and configuration of POP3 and SMTP mail clients.\n\n· Technical support to customers.\n\n· Analysis and debugging of software. Bug fixing in VB6, ASP3, VB.NET, ASP.NET.\n\n· Migration of applications from ASP3/VB6 to ASP.NET/.NET.\n\n· Implementation of an FTP based application for internal regular backup.",
